<title>FRANCE: GTM Entrepose H1 net loss 23 million Ffr.</title>
<headline>GTM Entrepose H1 net loss 23 million Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable loss			 23  vs   loss     18</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			   18.8, no comparison</p>
<p>NOTE - GTM entrepose published its results in a statement. It said activity of many of the group's companies was seasonal and the first half results were not representative of the full year. It said all sectors had maintained their level of activity except for building, which saw turnover fall by 16 percent in France, and roads, whose sales fell seven percent in France.</p>
<p>Lyonnaise des Eaux holds 48 percent of GTM Entrepose.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
